ins":["**Accord Transformer & Switchgear** -- Rs 44.68 cr purchase order from Bhabha Power for 240 compact substations (25 KVA to 1000 KVA), 24-month execution (~23.7% of mcap).","**Krystal Integrated Services** -- Rs 15 cr, 4-month work order from People's Association for Total Help & Youth Applause for legacy-waste transportation/disposal under the MBMC Bio-Remediation Project (~1.8% of mcap).","**Sotefin Bharat** -- Rs 10.27 cr order from Shree Naman Hotels for a fully automated Silomat parking system at the Sofitel BKC Mumbai extension (210 car spaces) (~2.6% of mcap).","**Bhadora Industries** -- Rs 9.62 cr purchase order from an undisclosed Indian energy-infrastructure company for LT XLPE and AB cables, 20-working-day delivery (~4.5% of mcap).","**Atishay** -- wins a new Rs 5.86 cr work order from UP's State Health Agency for printing/delivery of PVC Ayushman Cards across 28 districts, replacing (quashing) its earlier Rs 4.86 cr order for the same scope (~4.3% of mcap).","**Eppeltone Engineers** -- receives a Rs 5.73 cr order for the manufacture and supply of electronic products, separate from its earlier Rs 31.41 cr energy-meters order (SME, ~4.0% of mcap).","**Cash Ur Drive Marketing** -- wins 3-year exclusive outdoor-advertising rights at Chandigarh Railway Station from Northern Railway via e-auction, Rs 7.01 cr contract value (~4.1% of mcap).","**JD Cables** -- bags a Rs 6.14 cr work order from an undisclosed private entity for manufacture, testing and supply of cables, 4-month delivery (SME, ~1.9% of mcap).","**Titagarh Rail Systems** -- bags a Rs 77.09 cr order from JSW (South) Rail Logistics for freight wagons; also gets Indian Railways route clearance to manufacture and dispatch auto-carrier wagons.","**V R Infraspace** -- Rs 1.45 cr government road-improvement work order from the Executive Engineer, Panchayat R&B Division, Amreli, 4-month execution (SME, ~1.7% of mcap).","**Siyaram Recycling** -- secures a Rs 1.40 cr order from Anurag Impex for brass billets and brass scrap honey (SME, ~2.0% of mcap).","**Maestros Electronics & Telecommunications Systems** -- Rs 1.20 cr purchase order from Garden Reach Ship Builders & Engineers for 12 telemedicine units for the Indian Navy (SME, ~1.2% of mcap).","**Shree Marutinandan Industries** -- Rs 0.27 cr purchase order from Mehta & Associates Fire Protection Systems for fire-fighting equipment at an Aditya Birla Renewable Energy site in Rajasthan (SME, ~1.6% of mcap).","**Sterling and Wilson Renewable Energy** -- discloses three domestic wins: a 600 MWh BESS turnkey order from a PSU in Gujarat, a 350 MW solar project from a private IPP in Rajasthan, plus an L1 (not yet awarded) position in Madhya Pradesh; combined value over Rs 2,050 cr across all three, per-project split not stated.","**Larsen & Toubro** -- subsidiary Vyoma.AI/LTN Compute wins a multi-year engagement to deploy additional NVIDIA B300 GPUs at its Chennai AI Factory for an undisclosed inference-infrastructure customer; L&T bands the order \"Large\" (Rs 2,500-5,000 cr, our reading of its own classification table).","**PTC Industries** -- secures an order from the Indian Defence Sector for ~400 tonnes of Titanium ingots, bars and rods via subsidiary Aerolloy Technologies, value not disclosed.","**Rail Vikas Nigam** -- wins a Letter of Award from NMDC for construction of a Super-Speciality Hospital for Women & Child Care at Kirandul, Chhattisgarh, value not disclosed."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Vaxtex Cotfab** -- Board approves, subject to shareholder/exchange approval, a preferential issue of up to 6.2 cr shares and 11.55 cr warrants at Rs 1.69 each to proposed promoter Truvista Holding, ~Rs 30 cr; separately seeks a broader Rs 250 cr enabling resolution with mode/investor not yet fixed.","**Adani Enterprises** -- step-down subsidiary Adani Airport Holdings signs a fresh subscription agreement with 360 ONE Alternates for an incremental Rs 2,790 cr (~USD 300 mn, ~1.55% of AAHL); combined with the September tranche, AAHL's total raise is now ~USD 1.35 bn for up to ~7.01% of AAHL."],"equity_allotments":["**Purple Finance** -- Board ratifies its already-approved (31-Aug EGM) preferential allotment of 99,99,952 shares at Rs 72 (Rs 71.99 cr), and separately moves a postal ballot for an equal-size share-swap issue to the former shareholders of Saksham Gram Credit.","**Shraddha Prime Projects** -- allots 60,60,150 partly paid-up rights equity shares at Rs 160 (Rs 144 payable on application), aggregating Rs 96.96 cr, completing its 14-Oct rights issue; paid-up capital now Rs 46.46 cr.","**Lead Reclaim and Rubber Products** -- allots 3,69,776 equity shares at Rs 75 on warrant conversion, Rs 2.77 cr; paid-up capital rises to Rs 10.89 cr (SME)."],"m_and_a":["**Bikewo Green Tech** -- acquires a 25% equity stake in Green Drive Auto Services (EV/logistics) for Rs 14.99 cr cash, extending into the energy layer for commercial transport; also clears un-priced enabling resolutions for a future share/warrant issue.","**Brigade Enterprises** -- acquires a 2.25-acre land parcel in Secunderabad for Rs 180 cr (outright purchase, sale deed registered), to develop a premium residential project with an estimated ~Rs 1,000 cr revenue potential (the filing's own estimate).","**Jupiter Wagons** -- signs a Framework Agreement with Korea's Woojin Industrial Systems to jointly bid for and manufacture metro coaches and propulsion/TCMS systems in India via a JV in which Jupiter Wagons is majority shareholder, value not disclosed.","**Protean eGov Technologies** -- signs a five-year MoU with Uttar Pradesh Police to modernise digital policing (secure data exchange, digital identity, AI-ready infrastructure), value not disclosed.","**Apollo Micro Systems** -- subsidiary Apollo Defence Industries issues a binding Expression of Interest to acquire 100% of the IEC Group (electrical rotating machines/generators/drives), entering indigenous defence electric-propulsion manufacturing; consideration not disclosed.","**3B BlackBio Dx** -- via subsidiary TRUPCR Europe, agrees to acquire 100% of UK's Epistem Limited for an upfront cash consideration of GBP 723,000 (cash-free/debt-free; no rupee equivalent stated in the filing), a separate deal from its already-disclosed Bilex SRL purchase."],"capex_core":["**Trishakti Industries** -- deploys Rs 92 cr of heavy machinery (60 units, from its XCMG order) into its equipment-rental fleet, taking cumulative capex under its Rs 400 cr FY25-FY27 programme to Rs 370 cr.","**Rajshree Polypack** -- commissions its new Paper Sleeving Machine (20 mn pieces/year capacity) at its Daman facility, commercial production begun 23-Nov after a tuning delay from the Sep-2025 target; investment amount not disclosed.","**Kshitij Polyline** -- announces an AED 25 mn (~Rs 65 cr per the filing) investment to build a plastics-recycling plant in the UAE, supporting its circular-economy push."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 54 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Advance Technoforge** -- October net sales Rs 7.68 cr (+130.30% YoY); April-October YTD Rs 44.04 cr."],"distress_risk":["**63 Moons Technologies** -- subsidiary National Spot Exchange initiates payout to claimants under its NCLT-approved Rs 1,950 cr One-Time Settlement, resolving the 2013 NSEL payment default after about 14 years; 92.81% of claimants (by number) voted in favour.","**Greenply Industries** -- West Bengal MSE Facilitation Council passes a Rs 4.77 cr arbitral award (Rs 2.03 cr principal plus Rs 2.73 cr interest) against the company in a manpower-supply payment dispute; company foresees no operational impact.","**Elpro International** -- manager Motilal Oswal submits the Exit Letter of Offer for the promoter group's (IGE, Zenox, Surbhit Dabriwala) delisting offer to residual public shareholders; price not stated in the cached pages."],"open_offers":["**Jaipan Industries Ltd** — RAJAT GOYAL open offer for 30.39% (15.86 lakh shares) at Rs 48 vs CMP 55.14 (-12.9%); change of control (Reg 4) + >25% acquisition (Reg 3(1)); **DO NOT TENDER - market pays more than the offer**; tender window not in PA (comes with DPS/LoF); mcap Rs 34 cr","**APL Apollo Tubes Limited** — Tata Steel Limited open offer (7.28 cr shares) at Rs 2,301.4 vs CMP 1,670 (+37.8%); change of control (Reg 4) + >25% acquisition (Reg 3(1)); no delisting intent; **TENDER - offer above market**; tender window not in PA (comes with DPS/LoF); mcap Rs 46,369 cr","**Tata Steel Limited** — acquirer not parsed open offer for 26.0% (7.28 cr shares) at Rs 2,100 vs CMP 163 (+1188.3%); change of control (Reg 4) + >25% acquisition (Reg 3(1)); **TENDER - offer above market**; tender window not in PA (comes with DPS/LoF); mcap Rs 203,481 cr"],"other_notable":["**Arkade Developers** -- receives a Letter of Intent for a ~2-acre redevelopment project in Tardeo, South Mumbai, marking its re-entry into the SoBo market; projected Gross Development Value ~Rs 1,500 cr (the company's own estimate, not a contract value).","**South Indian Bank** -- RBI approves SBI Mutual Fund acquiring aggregate holding of up to 9.99% of the Bank's paid-up capital/voting rights; no shares acquired yet.","**Lupin** -- receives US FDA approval for its Ferric Citrate Tablets (210 mg), a generic of Keryx's Auryxia (reference drug's estimated US sales USD 58.1 mn, IQVIA MAT Sep-2026).","**Max Estates** -- sells out the first phase of The Bungalows, Sector 59 Gurugram (131 homes, 7.7 lakh sqft), achieving ~Rs 2,319 cr in sales against an overall project GDV of ~Rs 4,000 cr.","**Lord's Mark Industries** -- secures a manufacturing licence for its radiation-free breast-cancer screening device, its second medical-device launch after an AI-enabled dialysis machine; proposed screening price below Rs 700/test.","**Bridge Securities** -- Managing Director Harshad Amrutlal Panchal agrees to sell his entire 11.11% stake (43,17,396 shares) to Doxtrec Trade via the open market at the prevailing price; Doxtrec does not acquire board/promoter status, consideration not disclosed.","**Panorama Studios International** -- acquires worldwide perpetual rights to the Hindi film \"Love All\" via a Buyout Assignment Agreement with Filmart Productions; consideration not disclosed."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","open_offers":"Open offers (PA)","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/4315310d-29f1-4921-8ad3-857e3b53db5f.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/KISL123_23112026153148_Reg30intimation23112026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/c5a41712-5568-4b9b-89d9-d9c32b7f4e17.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/BHADORA_23112026184700_Intimation_new_order.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/81fdf782-75f7-41d2-86ac-4f4eba510f96.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/EPPELTONE_23112026100748_Intimation_1.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/CASHURDRIVE_23112026201438_Intimation_of_Press_Release.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/79f108a5-a3f1-4e92-b8fc-7fec8b950f6f.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/TWL_23112026124022_PressRelease23112026ACTwagons.pdf","declared":true,"mcap"